{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_03",
  "title": "拔铳相助",
  "storyCode": "DH-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b7522bcf7eda02a0ce47c11fd3b3a6c2188397e49f62b6f6f02bc96efc384e34",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "太惊人了，陈女侠，先是杀入巷子中救下被围攻的水月选手，然后直接在巷子中与其他参赛选手对峙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "其他队伍看来也已经认定鼠胆龙威队是个巨大的威胁，非常默契地达成了联手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "但是即使如此，陈女侠也丝毫不惧，选择与他们开战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "真是一场酣畅淋漓的战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "不过我们也不能忘记在巷子的另一边，林女侠的战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "和陈女侠在巷子中激烈的战斗不同，林女侠在巷子口仅凭几招就威慑住了赶来的其他队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "这次大奖赛中，真的有能够战胜这个组合的队伍存在吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "哈哈，这两个人果然还是适合各打各的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "哎，Missy，你猜老陈和林小姐对打的话，谁会赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "问这个干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "就是很感兴趣啊，两个很厉害的人放一起，一般都会想知道谁更厉害吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "只有你才会这么想吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "反正我不知道，今天是我这几年第一次看到这个女人真的出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "啊？你不是和林小姐关系很好吗，这都没见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "谁和她关系好啊，整天神神秘秘的，有的时候电话都打不通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "而且谁说熟了就一定要看过对方动手啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "也有道理，看来是我跟老陈相处习惯了。老陈现在想赢我可不能只靠她那套剑法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "别把所有人都当成你们俩好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "再说了，我没见过才好，我怕哪天我见到的时候就是要抓她的时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "有道理，毕竟是那位鼠王的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "哎，不过也不能这么说，那位也不是什么坏人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "我刚来龙门混的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "行了，我又不是没见过鼠王，还用你告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "嗨，你明白就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "比起这个，你刚才用了“混”字吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "瞧我，在诗大小姐面前说粗话，该掌嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "所以你和老陈就见过她出手啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "我这不是没有才来问你嘛，老陈我估计也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "有一点你说得倒是没错，没见过她出手对我们这种立场的人是好事，不然熟归熟，该做的少不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "知道就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "所以我也没想到，居然会有老陈和她联手的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "真是活久了什么都能见到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "说回刚才的话题，所以你觉得谁会赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "懒得猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "哎，那我自己猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "要我说，老陈要是拿着剑，林雨霞大概很难近她的身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "但是，要是让林雨霞近了身，老陈就输定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "陈这么菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "也不能这么说，老陈的拳脚功夫肯定是不差的，擒拿、关节技什么的，咱们平时培训的她都做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "你看她刚才打的，她用铳准头也不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "但是老陈毕竟拿手的是剑术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "你的意思是林雨霞的拳脚功夫相当于老陈的剑术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "陈晖洁，逞英雄开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "不怎么开心，不过也不用你操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "抱歉，陈小姐，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "我说了，你在那里等我就好，你做得没有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "谢谢你帮了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "不过，你为什么要帮我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "不为什么，看到了，就帮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "这样啊。姐姐你是个好人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "既然这样，给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "这是......赤金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "嗯，我刚才就是想拿这个才被他们围住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "给我们没关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "没事，我再去找就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "而且，我本来就不是很在乎比赛，能够认识陈姐姐这样的好人，对我来说已经很满足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "提醒一下，这里已经惊动了不少队伍，想聊天可以，别在这里停留太久比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": "avg_437_mizuki_1",
      "text": "那我就先走啦，拜拜~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "我们也走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "姑且问一下，你那边除了逞英雄还有什么收获吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "赤金不算收获？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "......没什么特别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "那，继续？还是交了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "先继续吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "好的，亲爱的观众们，我这边刚才已经收到了二十块赤金全部提交的信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "也就是说，第一轮比赛到此圆满结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "那么，接下来，我们将开启投票环节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "投票环节将持续几个小时，在结束后，我们将在主舞台公布第一轮的出线队伍，不要错过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "......结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "等一下还有观众投票环节，不过以两位现在的人气，肯定是不会有问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "不过看起来林小姐也没有找到危险分子的有关线索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "我这边没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "那有可能确实不存在这样的人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "或许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "陈晖洁，等下有空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "找你有事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
